== Inventory (HandMade) crafting ==

A small set of essential tools can be crafted from any location with no external workbench, via the '''Inventory''' menu (default: '''C'''). These are handled by the internal '''HandMade''' workbench. Common HandMade recipes include:

* '''Stone Axe''': Wood + Stone
* '''Stone Pickaxe''': Wood + Stone

== Progression path ==

Workbenches unlock roughly in this order, gated by biome and ore availability:

{| class="wikitable"
! Tier !! Workbench !! Unlocked by !! Enables
|-
| 0 || HandMade || Start || Stone tools
|-
| 0 || Campfire || Wood + Stone || Utility items
|-
| 1 || Carpentry || Wood tools || Bows, wooden weapons, arrows
|-
| 1 || Cutting || Basic tools || Cut materials
|-
| 2 || Furnace || Stone + Iron Ore || Iron / copper / steel ingots
|-
| 2 || Anvil || Furnace + Iron Ingots || Metal weapons, armor
|-
| 3 || Cement Mixer || Stone + Sand || Reinforced structures
|-
| 3 || Mechanical || Metal tier || Vehicle parts, engines
|-
| 4 || Electronics || Copper + rare metals || Circuits, [[Lua Programming|Lua computers]]
|-
| 4 || Biochemical || Jungle reagents || Medicine, gunpowder
|-
| 4 || Gun || Electronics + Biochemical || Firearms, ammunition
|}

